# Oscar Bahamonde — complete site guide
> Public professional information. Prices are starting estimates in Peruvian soles.

## Perfil / Profile
Soy Oscar. Ingeniero de software, datos e inteligencia artificial. Me muevo entre la profundidad técnica y la visión de producto: del primer prototipo a la infraestructura que lo sostiene.
He trabajado con equipos globales en backend, datos y confiabilidad. Hoy ayudo a convertir necesidades de negocio en tecnología útil y mantenible.
I’m Oscar, a software, data and artificial intelligence engineer. I work at the intersection of technical depth and product thinking, from the first prototype to the infrastructure behind it.
I’ve worked with global teams in backend, data and reliability. Today I help turn business needs into useful, maintainable technology.
## Logros / Achievements
Primer puesto de ingreso a la PUCP · Computación general · 2007
Ganador del hackathon AWS User Group Perú · 2023 · Más de 50 equipos · Plataforma para desarrolladores potenciada por ChatGPT.
AWS Speaker

## Services
Prices in PEN, starting estimates only: landing with up to 5 sections and email form S/500; CMS with Calendar/email S/1500; e-commerce MVP with database, API, authentication, one checkout, basic CRM S/3500; first custom SaaS/PaaS/streaming MVP phase S/4500; client-data AI assistant S/1500; systems/legacy API integration S/3500; initial cloud migration S/5000; data platform audit S/1800; infrastructure/cost audit S/1200. Third-party fees, hosting and maintenance quoted separately. No fixed delivery promises. 1:1 consulting is exactly S/20 for 30 minutes, paid with MercadoPago, Calendar availability Monday–Friday 09:00–13:00 and 14:00–17:00 America/Lima. Direct visitors to #contact to book. Never claim a meeting is booked through chat.

## Booking
S/20 · 30 minutes · Google Meet. Monday–Friday 09:00–13:00 and 14:00–17:00, America/Lima. A slot is held for 15 minutes; only verified MercadoPago payment confirms the appointment.
